update SEMANTIC_BOUNDARY
Update is revision-oriented: it treats a Source as verified change evidence and semantically patches an existing Target. Meld is merge-oriented: it semantically combines two inputs while reconciling their relationships and conflicts, either into an existing Baseline or a new Result.
